<title>GREECE: TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 404 bps, 301 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 404 bps, 301 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread between Greece's 10-year bond over bunds widened to 404 basis points on Tuesday from Monday's 402.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap also widened to 301 basis points from 298 on Monday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.64%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.60%	404	402 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.52%	412	408 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.63%	301	298 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.34%	330	328 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.27%	337	333 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.12%	252	255 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.31%	333	335 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0931 GMT.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
